  "question": {
    "text": "A point object in air is in front of the curved surface of a plano-convex lens. The radius of curvature of the curved surface is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and the refractive index of the lens material is <math><mn>1.5</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the focal length of the lens (in cm) is ___________.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "60",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#x221E;</mo></math><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo> </mo><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>∞</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />f = 60cm",
